; The one variable: a root-owned heading below a trail-seated heading claims a name that the base
; of an inherited root claimed first. The base keeps it (node.cpp:2222-2233), so `parent="%Feather"`
; seats the green Quill on the base's blue Feather, right of the origin, not on the orange Cap.
; No other golden claims a name the base holds.

